<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-17-blinded-sample-audit-lobo-limbform-morphology-source-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "LimbformDB limb morphologies — Source and data traceability: 94/100" ;
    rdfs:comment "Cites both primary papers (Lobo et al. 2014a, DOI 10.1093/bioinformatics/btu582; Lobo et al. 2014b, DOI 10.1002/reg2.13) and the upstream LimbformDB 2.1.0 URL, and links every rendered panel to its database Morphology.Id and Experiment record. Deducts 6 points because DB_SHA256 on line 92 contains a 65-character hex string (an extra trailing '0' appended to the true 64-character SHA-256 digest), so resolve_db_path() always prints a false-positive hash mismatch warning. Evidence: 2014-lobo-limbform-morphology.py L1–L56: docstring citing Lobo et al. (2014a, 2014b) DOIs and LimbformDB 2.1.0 URL <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/5659d5e/2014-lobo-limbform-morphology.py#L1-L56>; 2014-lobo-limbform-morphology.py L91–L134: DB_SHA256 has 65 hex chars (trailing '0' typo at L92), triggering mismatch warning in resolve_db_path() <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/5659d5e/2014-lobo-limbform-morphology.py#L91-L134>." ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:evaluatesHypothesis <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/hypothesis/morphoeval-lobo-limbform-morphology-source-traceability> ;
    pk:hasProbability 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-17-blinded-sample-audit-lobo-limbform-morphology-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "LimbformDB limb morphologies — Morphological realism / specimen match: 86/100" ;
    rdfs:comment "Reconstructs the five wild-type benchmark limbs from Lobo et al. (2014b) Fig. 1 A''-E'' (Ambystoma mexicanum, Xenopus laevis, Uca pugilator, Gryllus bimaculatus, Heteropoda venatoria), all 14 wild-type species in LimbformDB 2.1.0, and 15 experimental surgical/transgenic phenotypes (ectopic grafts, supernumerary hands, hip-rotation duplications, and retinoic-acid proximalisation) with matching segment topology, digit counts, and colour coding. Note: comparison is to the source paper's formalism cartoons rather than photographs of biological limbs. Evidence: 2014-lobo-limbform-morphology.py L627–L738: make_wildtype_gallery(), make_experimental_gallery(), and make_animation() <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/5659d5e/2014-lobo-limbform-morphology.py#L627-L738>; limbform_wildtype_gallery.png (generated output, not in repo): 14 wild-type limb morphologies rendered with Fig. 1 A''-E'' highlighted — limbform_wildtype_gallery.png: rendered output of 2014-lobo-limbform-morphology.py at 5659d5e, image/png, 620043 B, 2400×1875 px, sha256 d561f4aab10756976c3fd5caf7a8c516da13c1cd9395d6cb5a54b8a2f5b10236; docs/media/limbform_morphospace_timeline.gif (generated output, not in repo): animated timeline and experimental regeneration outcomes from LimbformDB — docs/media/limbform_morphospace_timeline.gif: rendered output of 2014-lobo-limbform-morphology.py at 5659d5e, image/gif, 2172060 B, 720×405 px, 66 frames, sha256 1997a7a304d4f6f3fb34e66dc598a2c601ba930391dfb0c674d73f9d2671b242." ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:evaluatesHypothesis <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/hypothesis/morphoeval-lobo-limbform-morphology-specimen-match> ;
    pk:hasProbability 8.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/2026-10-17-blinded-sample-audit-planform-morphology-animation-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "PlanformDB planarian morphology animation — Code-to-model traceability: 82/100" ;
    rdfs:comment "Module docstring and function comments clearly document the database schema, the +y anterior coordinate convention, the link-degree radius rule, and the superellipse boundary construction. Evidence: 2013-lobo-planform-morphology.py L18–L37: documented graph formalism and coordinate convention <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/5659d5e/2013-lobo-planform-morphology.py#L18-L37>; 2013-lobo-planform-morphology.py L353–L385: region_outline() superellipse arc documentation <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/5659d5e/2013-lobo-planform-morphology.py#L353-L385>." ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:evaluatesHypothesis <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/hypothesis/morphoeval-planform-morphology-animation-code-traceability> ;
