    rdfs:label "Gray-Scott reaction-diffusion patterns — Source and data traceability: 15/100" ;
    rdfs:comment "No module docstring, no bibliographic references, no DOIs for Turing (1952), Gray & Scott (1984), or Pearson (1993), and no provenance for the chosen parameter values; only the filename and plot title ('Turing Patterns (Gray-Scott Model)') name the model. Evidence: 1952-turing-morpho.py L1–L13: no docstring or literature citations <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/5659d5e/1952-turing-morpho.py#L1-L13>; 1952-turing-morpho.py L74–L75: plot title is the sole textual reference <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/5659d5e/1952-turing-morpho.py#L74-L75>." ;
